# Official Grant Account — validation & error messages

Partners do **not** save bank from Lookup (request-only). Validation applies when **SELPIC admins** complete Official Grant Account on Partner Registry / before Mark Paid.

## Phase 1 — format + ABN checksum

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| Account name | Required, trimmed |
| ABN | 11 digits + ABR checksum |
| BSB | Exactly 6 digits |
| Account number | 6–10 digits |
| Bank name | Optional |

Source: `lib/fundraising/grantAccountValidation.ts` (+ `abn.ts`).

## Phase 2 (backlog — recognised BSB)

Validate BSB against a maintained AU BSB list; block Save on miss.
